qa-out/

# SCRATCH BUILDS. An agent comparing two renders builds a second dist beside
# the real one; each is ~41 MB and none of them belong in history. Two got
# committed by a `git add -A` earlier in this project's life, once as roughly
# 400 files. One pattern instead of naming them one at a time as they appear.
dist-*/

